<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said Friday it would auction 3.3 billion pesos of Cetes at the primary auction on October 1.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  22.87 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  25.06 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  24.66 pct</p>
<p>    364 days     600 million pesos  21.97 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 150 million UDIs of 1,064-day UDIbonos and 800 million pesos in two-year Bondes.</p>
<p>--Martin Langfield, Mexico City Newsroom 525 7289558</p>
</text>
